Z||000000||doughboySE||08-13-2000||10:20 PM||||damn it anyway its always something isnt it.<BR>drove to newmarket on sat car ran like a dream cost me 10 bucks to drive 265kms at 130 kms per hour, so i cant complain.<BR>i get there get checked in and go to get my clothing out of the trunk,keeping in mind that my lock on the trunk has never worked by key.<BR>so i pop the trunk from the inside (no go) i try this for 45 min getting madder and madder each try. so me with my temper grabs a straight head screwdriver and jams it in the key hole and twists. snnnnap krackle pop. trunk open clothing out and i now need to get a new lock for my trunk.<BR>anyway hehe car ran great  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
