Z||000002||mrfiero||08-14-2000||12:23 AM||||Unfortunately it is that easy to access the trunk.  I have done this on a few occasions myself....just a common screwdriver and a hammer is all it takes.  If you take it easy and do it carefully you won't damage anything other than the lock itself.<P> ||||reg||1
